      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 071 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Introducing Academies)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "After school, most of my friends and I go to academies."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "There are many academies that teach different subjects."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I go to a piano academy, English academy,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and art academy near my home."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Some of my other friends go to more academies than I do,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "so they are very busy every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "They have very little time to play with me during the week."
    },
